OL,3,GNEWSAWork on delayed hospital enters
OL,4,Anext phase
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a delayed new hospital has
OL,7,Fentered a new phase.
OL,9,FThe 12-month programme on the former
OL,10,FConsett Steelworks site will get the
OL,11,Fland ready for construction of the new
OL,12,FShotley Bridge Hospital.
OL,14,FIt includes creating new road
OL,15,Finfrastructure and access from the
OL,16,FA692, bus laybys, footpaths, utilities
OL,17,Fand sustainable drainage.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
