OL,3,GNEWSAWork on delayed hospital enters
OL,4,Anext phase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe site is scheduled to be handed over
OL,7,Fto County Durham and Darlington NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust in September 2027,
OL,9,Fallowing construction to begin. The
OL,10,Fhospital is expected to be completed by
OL,11,F2030.
